[en.CHARACTER_WIND_RIDER_NAME]
Wind Rider

[en.CHARACTER_WIND_RIDER_DESC]
Wind Rider is a former Wonderbolts member and the record holder for the fastest long-distance flight (until the record was broken by Rainbow Dash). He was expelled from the Wonderbolts for framing Rainbow Dash, but discovered his talent for acting through that incident and went on to play various villainous roles in stage productions. By the time of the Ultimate Battle, he had accumulated a certain amount of wealth through his acting career. After Cloudsdale was taken over by the Royal Commission and the Chamber of Commerce, he actively joined the Chamber, climbing all the way up from a new member to the Chairpony. Just like himself and the characters he plays, Wind Rider’s business strategies are always full of conspiracies and tricks, and his business is far from clean. When he once again tried to persuade the newly appointed Duchess Derpy of Cloudsdale through deception and performance, he encountered an unexpected failure due to his lack of understanding of muffins. Now, Wind Rider is trying to expand his business to the Stratusburg area, but... what exactly does his company do? It seems that not many ponies really know.

[zh.CHARACTER_WIND_RIDER_NAME]
乘风

[zh.CHARACTER_WIND_RIDER_DESC]
乘风是曾经的闪电天马队队员，也是长距离飞行最快速度纪录的保持者（直到被云宝黛西打破）。他因为诬陷云宝黛茜而被闪电天马队开除，后来通过那一次事件发现了自己的演员天赋，出演了多个剧目中的反派形象。凭借着演艺事业，他在终末之战前就积累起了一定的财富。在云中城被皇家委员会与商业委员会接管后，他也积极参与，从一位新成员一路上升到了商业委员会的主席。正如他自己和他所饰演的那些角色一样，乘风的商业策略中总是隐藏着许多阴谋与诡计，他的生意也并不能称得上干净。在尝试像以前一样通过欺骗与表演劝说新上任的云中城领主呆蹄时，他由于不了解马芬而遭遇了出乎意外的失败。如今的乘风尝试将商业业务的重心到层云堡地区，但... 他是主要经营什么业务的？似乎没多少小马真的清楚。
